        "original_id": "b9f9bf6c-6ca2-5bc6-8cee-1eb2b5fba573",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Laurence Fishburne, Dutch Schultz, Tim Roth, Lucky Luciano, Andy García, Davina\n- Films: Hoodlum\n- Music: \"So Good\"\n- Organizations: the first Commission\n- Concepts: modern organized crime in the United States\n\nFacts:\n- The film Hoodlum concentrated on Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, played by Laurence Fishburne, Dutch Schultz, played by Tim Roth, and Lucky Luciano, played by Andy García.\n- Lucky Luciano is considered the father of modern organized crime in the United States for establishing the first Commission.\n- Davina's 1997 single \"So Good\" became the theme song for the film Hoodlum.",
